Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:34:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1417/1463] HERESY 1464: a plugin step on a set of stems picks
 a set, not a file; Run shut until there is one
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A step that says input: stems gets «A set of stems» for its source: the take's sets, each once (eight stems, six stems, from the debuzzed…), the newest first chosen; with none it says to split the take first and Run stays shut; the run sends the set's folder. Two new strings in all eleven catalogs. Kitchen suite 824/0 (one new check).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
